[1560.260081, "o", "\u001b[2m│ [headless:pr-1297]\u001b[0m Change is well-scoped. Now the adversarial deep-pass — I need to verify the load-bearing integration points in `main.rs` that the diff *relies on* but doesn't show: where `branches` comes from, whether `any_parked_or_waited` actually drives exit 2, and whether the `parent_branch` stored in the stack graph is the short form (`main`) the planner compares against.\r\n"]
